<%#
  "You're not signed in to Fly" — the one place this message is written.

  Shown in two places:
    context: :settings — Settings → Deploy, as a warning before deploying.
    context: :deploy   — the Updates page, when a deploy was stopped by it.

  Both say the same thing; only the box and the last step differ. Roe checks
  the sign-in in DeployPreflight#fly_signed_out_issue, which keeps just the
  issue's name and title (the deploy log and error line need the title).
  Everything you see is here.

  Locals:
    context — :settings or :deploy (default :deploy)
    hidden  — start hidden (Settings hides it while Kamal is chosen)
%>
<% context = local_assigns.fetch(:context, :deploy).to_sym %>
<% settings = context == :settings %>

<div <%= 'id="fly-auth-warning"'.html_safe if settings %>
     class="<%= settings ? 'mb-4 border border-amber-300 bg-amber-50 p-4' : 'bg-white border border-red-300 rounded-xs p-3 mb-3' %> <%= 'hidden' if local_assigns[:hidden] %>">
  <h3 class="<%= settings ? 'text-sm font-semibold text-amber-900 mb-1' : 'text-xs font-semibold text-red-900 uppercase font-mono mb-1' %>">
    <%= DeployPreflight::FLY_SIGNED_OUT_TITLE %>
  </h3>

  <% text = settings ? "text-sm text-amber-800" : "text-xs text-gray-700 font-sans" %>
  <p class="<%= text %> mb-3">
    Your Fly session has expired, or you haven't signed in on this computer yet.
    <% if settings %>
      Deploying without one hangs with no output rather than failing, so sign in first.
    <% else %>
      Deploying without one hangs with no output rather than failing, so Roe stopped before it started.
    <% end %>
  </p>

  <ol class="<%= text %> mb-3 list-decimal list-inside space-y-1">
    <li>Open a terminal — any folder will do.</li>
    <li>Run the command below. It opens your browser.</li>
    <li>Sign in to Fly. You'll see &ldquo;Your CLI is connected now. Feel free to close this tab.&rdquo;</li>
    <li>Back in the terminal you'll see <code class="font-mono text-xs <%= settings ? 'bg-amber-100' : 'bg-gray-100' %> px-0.5">successfully logged in as &lt;your email&gt;</code></li>
    <li><%= settings ? "Reload this page." : "Then deploy again." %></li>
  </ol>

  <div class="font-mono text-xs bg-white border <%= settings ? 'border-amber-200' : 'border-gray-200' %> p-3 mb-3">
    <p class="select-all">fly auth login</p>
  </div>

  <p class="<%= text %>">
    More detail:
    <a href="/documentation/roe/troubleshoot-deployment#fly-signed-out" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline">Troubleshooting → Deployment</a>
  </p>
</div>
